   "source": "documented",
   "help": "The DNS record type to be queried for. When this option is not present, the default value is \"A\". This option can be specified multiple times to query for multiple record types. Record types you may want to query include, but are not limited to, A, AAAA, MX, NS, TXT.",
   "kind": "option",
